# Generated outputs land here. Committed deliberately after a run, not before.
# `**` rather than `*` because run_arm.py writes answers to runs/{arm}/ and
# transcripts to runs/transcripts/{arm}/ — one level deeper, which a single-star
# pattern misses, which is how a partial run's raw transcripts nearly got
# committed before there was anything to compare them against.
runs/**/*.md
runs/manifest_*.jsonl
results.tsv

# RESULTS.md and TRIGGERING.md are deliberately NOT ignored: once there are real
# numbers the write-up is the deliverable, and the top-level README links to it.
# Generate them from real manifests only — report.py and trigger_benchmark.py both
# take --out so a test or a partial run can write somewhere harmless instead.
